<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title || 'Download Edutrack Apps' %></title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/uploads/logos/system-logo.png">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest">
    <style>
        :root {
            --ink: #10231c;
            --muted: #62756d;
            --green: #06996b;
            --green-deep: #037252;
            --green-dark: #064f3d;
            --green-soft: #eaf8f2;
            --line: #d7e6df;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --soft: #f5faf8;
            --danger: #df3f3f;
            --shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(16, 35, 28, 0.18);
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: var(--ink);
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        a { color: inherit; }

        .hero {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            min-height: 100vh;
            min-height: 100svh;
            color: #ffffff;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 88% 8%, rgba(255,255,255,0.18) 0 126px, transparent 128px),
                radial-gradient(circle at 24% 42%, rgba(77, 255, 186, 0.16), transparent 310px),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #08ad78 0%, #078a62 52%, #045c42 100%);
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: -12vw;
            right: -12vw;
            bottom: -176px;
            height: 332px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
            transform: rotate(3.2deg);
            box-shadow: inset 0 18px 34px rgba(6, 114, 82, 0.08);
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .wrap {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .brand-bar {
            min-height: 88px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .brand {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .brand img {
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 3px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(5, 79, 61, 0.22);
        }

        .brand strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: 0;
        }

        .brand span {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 3px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .hero-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.92fr 1fr;
            gap: clamp(44px, 6vw, 92px);
            align-items: center;
            padding: 16px 0 154px;
        }

        .phone-shell {
            position: relative;
            width: min(318px, 92vw);
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 8px;
            border-radius: 39px;
            background:
                linear-gradient(145deg, #ff9d1f 0%, #f47b12 42%, #c04700 72%, #7a2100 100%);
            box-shadow:
                0 38px 96px rgba(4, 55, 42, 0.28),
                0 18px 56px rgba(174, 73, 0, 0.34),
                inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(255, 184, 78, 0.88),
                inset 0 0 0 5px rgba(29, 15, 8, 0.88);
        }

        .phone-shell::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            z-index: 5;
            top: 14px;
            left: 50%;
            width: 86px;
            height: 22px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #0c1512;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        }

        .phone-shell::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            right: -3px;
            top: 116px;
            width: 4px;
            height: 52px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #b13a00;
            box-shadow: inset 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 173, 69, 0.55);
        }

        .phone-screen {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 2px solid #17110c;
            border-radius: 31px;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 14%, rgba(8, 133, 95, 0.08), transparent 130px),
                #f4faf7;
            height: 586px;
        }

        .phone-header {
            padding: 39px 12px 9px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
            color: var(--ink);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2ece7;
        }

        .phone-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 9px;
        }

        .phone-brand img {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 2px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(6, 114, 82, 0.14);
        }

        .phone-title {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .phone-subtitle {
            margin-top: 2px;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .phone-chip-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 6px;
            margin-top: 9px;
        }

        .phone-chip {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
            min-height: 25px;
            padding: 0 8px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #f4faf7;
            border: 1px solid #dcebe4;
            color: var(--green-dark);
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .live-dot {
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
            flex: 0 0 auto;
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ff3f3f;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(255, 63, 63, 0.16);
            isolation: isolate;
            animation: liveDotCore 1.45s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .live-dot::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: -5px;
            z-index: -1;
            border-radius: inherit;
            background: rgba(255, 63, 63, 0.32);
            transform: scale(0.62);
            opacity: 0.9;
            animation: liveDotPulse 1.45s ease-out infinite;
        }

        .phone-body {
            flex: 1;
            min-height: 0;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        .greeting-card,
        .analytics-card,
        .weekly-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(16, 35, 28, 0.08);
        }

        .greeting-card {
            padding: 11px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .greeting-card small {
            display: block;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
            font-size: 9px;
        }

        .greeting-card strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.2;
            color: #121c18;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .stat-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 6px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .compact-stat {
            min-height: 56px;
            padding: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #dcebe4;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #f6faf8;
        }

        .compact-icon {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            border-radius: 7px;
            background: #e3f8ef;
            position: relative;
        }

        .compact-icon.present::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            left: 6px;
            top: 4px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--green);
        }

        .compact-icon.present::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 13px;
            height: 6px;
            left: 4px;
            bottom: 4px;
            border-radius: 8px 8px 3px 3px;
            background: var(--green);
        }

        .compact-icon.absent {
            background: #fff0f0;
        }

        .compact-icon.absent::before,
        .compact-icon.absent::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 12px;
            height: 3px;
            left: 4px;
            top: 9px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--danger);
        }

        .compact-icon.absent::before { transform: rotate(45deg); }
        .compact-icon.absent::after { transform: rotate(-45deg); }

        .compact-stat b {
            display: block;
            color: #071a14;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .compact-stat span {
            color: #53665f;
            display: block;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .analytics-card {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.86fr 1fr;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .ring {
            width: 84px;
            height: 84px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: conic-gradient(#0aa16f 0 var(--rate), #d7f2e7 var(--rate) 100%);
        }

        .ring span {
            width: 62px;
            height: 62px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #071a14;
            font-size: 21px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .analytics-copy strong {
            display: block;
            color: #101b16;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.08;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .analytics-copy span {
            display: block;
            color: #34463f;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.35;
        }

        .rate-line {
            margin-top: 7px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
            gap: 8px;
            align-items: center;
            color: #2d3e37;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .rate-track {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            height: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #dcebe4;
        }

        .rate-track i {
            display: block;
            width: var(--rate);
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: inherit;
            background: var(--green);
        }

        .weekly-card {
            padding: 11px;
        }

        .weekly-title {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 7px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .weekly-title small {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 3px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 9px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .bars {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            gap: 4px;
            align-items: end;
        }

        .day {
            min-height: 56px;
            display: grid;
            justify-items: center;
            align-items: end;
            padding: 5px 3px;
            border-radius: 11px;
            background: #f7faf8;
            color: #53665f;
            font-size: 8px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .day i {
            width: 18px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #e94646;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-style: normal;
            font-size: 9px;
        }

        .day:nth-child(1) i { height: 25px; }
        .day:nth-child(2) i { height: 31px; }
        .day:nth-child(3) i { height: 23px; }
        .day:nth-child(4) i { height: 34px; }
        .day:nth-child(5) i { height: 27px; }

        .phone-nav {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            gap: 2px;
            padding: 6px 9px 9px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2ece7;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.94);
        }

        .phone-nav span {
            text-align: center;
            color: #5e7069;
            font-size: 7px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .phone-nav b {
            display: block;
            width: 22px;
            height: 19px;
            margin: 0 auto 3px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #edf7f3;
            color: #087a59;
            position: relative;
        }

        .phone-nav b::before,
        .phone-nav b::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            background: #087a59;
        }

        .phone-nav .home::before {
            width: 13px;
            height: 10px;
            left: 6px;
            bottom: 5px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .phone-nav .home::after {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            left: 7px;
            top: 4px;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .phone-nav .attendance::before {
            width: 13px;
            height: 15px;
            left: 7px;
            top: 4px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid #087a59;
        }

        .phone-nav .attendance::after {
            width: 9px;
            height: 2px;
            left: 9px;
            top: 11px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #087a59;
        }

        .phone-nav .schools::before {
            width: 15px;
            height: 9px;
            left: 6px;
            top: 6px;
            transform: skewY(-24deg);
        }

        .phone-nav .schools::after {
            width: 13px;
            height: 5px;
            left: 7px;
            bottom: 5px;
            border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;
        }

        .phone-nav .report::before {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            left: 6px;
            top: 5px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid #087a59;
        }

        .phone-nav .report::after {
            width: 2px;
            height: 8px;
            left: 10px;
            bottom: 6px;
            box-shadow: 4px -3px 0 #087a59, 8px 1px 0 #087a59;
        }

        .phone-nav .alerts::before {
            width: 12px;
            height: 13px;
            left: 7px;
            top: 5px;
            border-radius: 8px 8px 4px 4px;
        }

        .phone-nav .alerts::after {
            width: 6px;
            height: 2px;
            left: 10px;
            bottom: 4px;
            border-radius: 999px;
        }

        .hero-copy {
            max-width: 700px;
            padding-top: 0;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            min-height: 34px;
            padding: 0 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 800;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease both, softPulse 2.8s ease-in-out infinite 0.8s;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 20px 0 14px;
            max-width: 720px;
            font-size: clamp(38px, 3.8vw, 56px);
            line-height: 1.08;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            text-wrap: balance;
            animation: fadeUp 0.75s ease 0.1s both;
        }

        .lead {
            max-width: 680px;
            margin: 0 0 24px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.93);
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.62;
            animation: fadeUp 0.75s ease 0.2s both;
        }

        .lead span {
            display: block;
        }

        .lead span + span {
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .download-row {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: center;
            animation: fadeUp 0.75s ease 0.3s both;
        }

        .store-button {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            min-height: 54px;
            padding: 0 28px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #0f1f19;
            color: #ffffff;
            border: 0;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 900;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(6, 79, 61, 0.26);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease, background 180ms ease;
        }

        .platform-logo-img {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            display: block;
            flex: 0 0 auto;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .platform-mark {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex: 0 0 auto;
            color: currentColor;
        }

        .platform-mark svg {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: block;
            fill: currentColor;
        }

        .platform-card-icon .platform-logo-img {
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
        }

        .platform-card-icon .platform-mark {
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            color: var(--green-deep);
        }

        .store-button.secondary {
            background: #ffffff;
            color: var(--green-deep);
        }

        .store-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 42px rgba(6, 79, 61, 0.3);
        }

        .store-button.ios-coming {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
            color: var(--green-deep);
        }

        .store-button.disabled {
            pointer-events: none;
            background: #80968e;
            color: #eef7f3;
        }

        .status {
            margin-top: 18px;
            max-width: 620px;
            color: <%= apkAvailable ? "#dbfff0" : "#ffe1e1" %>;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 16px rgba(3, 88, 63, 0.42);
            animation: fadeUp 0.75s ease 0.4s both;
        }

        .content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
            margin: 52px auto 74px;
        }

        @keyframes fadeUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(18px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes softPulse {
            0%, 100% {
                box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15), 0 0 0 rgba(94, 255, 195, 0);
            }
            50% {
                box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.24), 0 0 26px rgba(94, 255, 195, 0.2);
            }
        }

        @keyframes liveDotPulse {
            0% {
                transform: scale(0.62);
                opacity: 0.85;
            }
            100% {
                transform: scale(1.95);
                opacity: 0;
            }
        }

        @keyframes liveDotCore {
            0%, 100% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(255, 63, 63, 0.14);
            }
            50% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(255, 63, 63, 0.22);
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *, *::before, *::after {
                animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
                scroll-behavior: auto !important;
                transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;
            }
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 660px;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            margin: 0 0 9px;
            font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px);
            letter-spacing: 0;
        }

        .section-title p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .app-card {
            min-height: 238px;
            padding: 24px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(16, 35, 28, 0.08);
        }

        .app-card .icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: var(--green-soft);
            color: var(--green-deep);
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .app-card .icon::before,
        .app-card .icon::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            background: var(--green-deep);
        }

        .app-card .platform-card-icon::before,
        .app-card .platform-card-icon::after {
            display: none;
        }

        .mobile-icon::before {
            width: 18px;
            height: 27px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 3px solid var(--green-deep);
        }

        .mobile-icon::after {
            width: 6px;
            height: 2px;
            bottom: 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
        }

        .desktop-icon::before {
            width: 27px;
            height: 18px;
            top: 12px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 3px solid var(--green-deep);
        }

        .desktop-icon::after {
            width: 22px;
            height: 3px;
            bottom: 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
        }

        .browser-icon::before {
            width: 28px;
            height: 22px;
            top: 13px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            background: transparent;
            border: 3px solid var(--green-deep);
        }

        .browser-icon::after {
            width: 22px;
            height: 3px;
            top: 20px;
            border-radius: 999px;
        }

        .app-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-size: 19px;
        }

        .app-card p {
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.55;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .card-link {
            color: var(--green-deep);
            font-weight: 900;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .desktop-note {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: var(--green-deep);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .desktop-showcase {
            margin-top: 0;
            padding: clamp(18px, 3vw, 34px);
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.78fr 1.22fr;
            gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 44px);
            align-items: center;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 28px;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 12% 15%, rgba(6, 153, 107, 0.12), transparent 260px),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #f4fbf8 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(16, 35, 28, 0.12);
        }

        .desktop-kicker {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            min-height: 30px;
            padding: 0 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            color: var(--green-deep);
            background: var(--green-soft);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .desktop-copy h3 {
            margin: 16px 0 10px;
            font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 42px);
            line-height: 1.04;
            letter-spacing: -0.025em;
        }

        .desktop-copy p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .desktop-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 22px;
        }

        .desktop-download {
            min-height: 48px;
            padding: 0 18px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            color: #ffffff;
            background: var(--green-dark);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 900;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(6, 79, 61, 0.2);
        }

        .desktop-download.secondary {
            color: var(--green-deep);
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
        }

        .macbook {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 690px;
            margin-left: auto;
        }

        .mac-lid {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 24px 24px 16px 16px;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #e8edf0 0%, #ffffff 44%, #c8d0d4 100%);
            box-shadow:
                0 28px 60px rgba(16, 35, 28, 0.2),
                inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
        }

        .mac-camera {
            position: absolute;
            top: 7px;
            left: 50%;
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #19251f;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .mac-screen {
            overflow: hidden;
            min-height: 382px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 2px solid #111b17;
            background: #edf3f7;
        }

        .mac-base {
            width: 104%;
            height: 20px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border-radius: 0 0 32px 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #d9e0e3 0%, #aeb8bd 100%);
            transform: translateX(-2%);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(16, 35, 28, 0.16);
        }

        .mac-base::before {
            content: "";
            display: block;
            width: 92px;
            height: 7px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border-radius: 0 0 999px 999px;
            background: rgba(81, 91, 96, 0.32);
        }

        .sds-ui {
            height: 382px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
            font-size: 7px;
            color: #0c1f18;
            background: #eef3f7;
        }

        .sds-sidebar {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            padding: 12px 9px;
            background: #0d382f;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .sds-side-brand {
            display: flex;
            gap: 7px;
            align-items: center;
            padding-bottom: 14px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
        }

        .sds-side-brand img {
            width: 26px;
            height: 26px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 1px;
        }

        .sds-side-brand strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 9px;
            line-height: 1.15;
        }

        .sds-side-brand span {
            display: block;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
            font-size: 5px;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .sds-menu-label {
            margin: 14px 0 6px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
            font-size: 5px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .sds-nav-item {
            padding: 8px 9px;
            border-radius: 7px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .sds-nav-item.active {
            color: #12d99a;
            background: #203f60;
        }

        .sds-side-user {
            margin-top: auto;
            padding-top: 10px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }

        .sds-side-user b {
            display: block;
            font-size: 7px;
        }

        .sds-side-user span {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
            font-size: 6px;
        }

        .sds-main {
            min-width: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .sds-topbar {
            height: 34px;
            padding: 0 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #d8e2ea;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(17, 31, 43, 0.08);
        }

        .sds-topbar strong {
            font-size: 10px;
        }

        .sds-profile {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 7px;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border: 1px solid #d8e2ea;
            border-radius: 9px;
            background: #f8fbfd;
        }

        .sds-avatar {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            color: #ffffff;
            background: var(--green);
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .sds-profile b {
            display: block;
            font-size: 7px;
        }

        .sds-profile span {
            display: block;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 5px;
        }

        .sds-content {
            padding: 12px;
        }

        .sds-banner {
            min-height: 50px;
            padding: 13px 14px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: #ffffff;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20c75c, #07994b);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 24px rgba(4, 153, 75, 0.2);
        }

        .sds-banner h4 {
            margin: 0 0 4px;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .sds-banner span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 7px;
        }

        .sds-rate {
            text-align: right;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .sds-rate small {
            display: block;
            font-size: 5px;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .sds-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 8px;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .sds-stat {
            min-height: 38px;
            padding: 8px 9px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 7px;
            border: 1px solid #dbe4ec;
            border-radius: 9px;
            background: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 7px 16px rgba(17, 31, 43, 0.08);
        }

        .sds-stat i {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: #e8fbf1;
        }

        .sds-stat b {
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .sds-stat span {
            color: #456179;
            font-size: 6px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .sds-bottom {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.78fr 1.22fr 0.9fr;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .sds-panel {
            min-height: 142px;
            padding: 9px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #dbe4ec;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        .sds-panel h5 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-size: 8px;
        }

        .sds-alert-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 22px minmax(0, 1fr);
            gap: 7px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            padding: 7px;
            border: 1px solid #ffe08a;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #fffbea;
        }

        .sds-initials {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            color: #ef3f57;
            background: #ffe0e6;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .sds-alert-row b,
        .sds-school-row b {
            display: block;
            font-size: 7px;
        }

        .sds-alert-row > div,
        .sds-school-row > div {
            min-width: 0;
        }

        .sds-alert-row span,
        .sds-school-row span {
            display: block;
            color: #5c748b;
            font-size: 5px;
        }

        .sds-alert-days {
            color: #ee2020;
            font-size: 6px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .sds-calendar {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr);
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .sds-date {
            min-height: 31px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 5px;
            color: transparent;
            background: #f0f4f8;
            font-size: 6px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .sds-date::after {
            content: "";
            width: 10px;
            height: 4px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #c2ced8;
        }

        .sds-date.absent {
            color: transparent;
            background: #ffe1e1;
            border: 1px solid #ffc7c7;
        }

        .sds-date.absent::after {
            background: #f09f9f;
        }

        .sds-date.absent small {
            display: none;
        }

        .sds-school-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 20px minmax(0, 1fr);
            gap: 8px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 6px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #edf1f5;
        }

        .sds-rank {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #fff1bf;
            color: #e38d00;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .sds-skeleton {
            display: block;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d4dee8 0%, #edf3f8 50%, #d4dee8 100%);
            background-size: 190% 100%;
            animation: sdsSkeleton 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .sds-skeleton.dark {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.22) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.46) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.22) 100%);
            background-size: 190% 100%;
        }

        .sds-skeleton.tight {
            margin-top: 3px;
        }

        @keyframes sdsSkeleton {
            0% { background-position: 180% 0; }
            100% { background-position: -180% 0; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 1180px) {
            .cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .desktop-showcase { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .macbook { margin: 0 auto; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 940px) {
            .hero-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 30px;
                padding-top: 10px;
                padding-bottom: 140px;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .hero-copy {
                margin: 0 auto;
                order: -1;
                padding-top: 0;
            }

            .lead, h1 { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
            .download-row { justify-content: center; }
            .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .desktop-copy { text-align: center; }
            .desktop-actions { justify-content: center; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 560px) {
            .wrap, .content { width: min(100% - 26px, 1120px); }
            .brand-bar { min-height: 68px; }
            .brand span { white-space: normal; }
            .hero::before { bottom: -132px; height: 264px; }
            .hero-grid { padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 112px; }
            h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 11vw, 46px); }
            .lead { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; }
            .store-button { width: 100%; }
            .phone-shell { width: min(292px, 100%); }
            .phone-screen { height: 548px; }
            .content { margin-top: 46px; }
            .desktop-showcase { padding: 16px; border-radius: 22px; }
            .desktop-download { width: 100%; }
            .mac-lid { padding: 8px; border-radius: 18px 18px 12px 12px; }
            .mac-screen { height: 248px; min-height: 0; }
            .sds-ui {
                width: 620px;
                height: 382px;
                transform: scale(0.61);
                transform-origin: top left;
            }
            .mac-base { height: 16px; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 390px) {
            .phone-shell { width: min(278px, 100%); }
            .phone-screen { height: 530px; }
            .mac-screen { height: 224px; }
            .sds-ui { transform: scale(0.55); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <% const safeStats = stats || {}; %>
    <% const totalStudents = safeStats.totalStudents || 0; %>
    <% const presentToday = safeStats.presentToday || 0; %>
    <% const attendanceRate = totalStudents ? Math.min(100, Math.round((presentToday / Math.max(totalStudents, 1)) * 100)) : 0; %>
    <% const landingSettings = (typeof settings !== 'undefined' && settings) ? settings : {}; %>
    <% const platformLogos = {
        android: landingSettings.platform_android_logo || '',
        ios: landingSettings.platform_ios_logo || '',
        windows: landingSettings.platform_windows_logo || '',
        mac: landingSettings.platform_mac_logo || landingSettings.platform_ios_logo || ''
    }; %>
    <% const escapeAttr = (value) => String(value || '').replace(/[&<>"']/g, function(ch) {
        return ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;', "'": '&#39;' })[ch];
    }); %>
    <% const platformFallbackSvgs = {
        android: '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.5 7.7 6 5.1a.75.75 0 0 1 1.3-.75L8.9 7a8.1 8.1 0 0 1 6.2 0l1.6-2.65a.75.75 0 1 1 1.3.75l-1.5 2.6A6.9 6.9 0 0 1 19 13v.6H5V13c0-2.2.95-4.1 2.5-5.3ZM8.4 11a.9.9 0 1 0 0-1.8.9.9 0 0 0 0 1.8Zm7.2 0a.9.9 0 1 0 0-1.8.9.9 0 0 0 0 1.8ZM5 15h14v4.1c0 .7-.55 1.25-1.25 1.25H6.25C5.55 20.35 5 19.8 5 19.1V15Z"/></svg>',
        ios: '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15.6 2.6c.05 1.1-.36 2.15-1.18 3.05-.8.88-1.86 1.4-2.9 1.32-.12-1.05.38-2.14 1.15-2.97.83-.9 2.02-1.47 2.93-1.4ZM19.3 16.6c-.45 1.02-.66 1.48-1.25 2.38-.8 1.22-1.94 2.74-3.35 2.76-1.25.01-1.57-.8-3.27-.79-1.7.01-2.06.8-3.3.8-1.41-.02-2.49-1.39-3.3-2.61-2.27-3.45-2.5-7.5-1.1-9.65 1-1.53 2.56-2.43 4.04-2.43 1.5 0 2.45.82 3.7.82 1.2 0 1.94-.82 3.68-.82 1.32 0 2.72.72 3.7 1.96-3.25 1.78-2.72 6.42.45 7.58Z"/></svg>',
        windows: '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5.2 10.9 4v7.1H3V5.2Zm9.1-1.35L21 2.5v8.6h-8.9V3.85ZM3 12.9h7.9V20L3 18.8v-5.9Zm9.1 0H21v8.6l-8.9-1.35V12.9Z"/></svg>',
        mac: '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15.6 2.6c.05 1.1-.36 2.15-1.18 3.05-.8.88-1.86 1.4-2.9 1.32-.12-1.05.38-2.14 1.15-2.97.83-.9 2.02-1.47 2.93-1.4ZM19.3 16.6c-.45 1.02-.66 1.48-1.25 2.38-.8 1.22-1.94 2.74-3.35 2.76-1.25.01-1.57-.8-3.27-.79-1.7.01-2.06.8-3.3.8-1.41-.02-2.49-1.39-3.3-2.61-2.27-3.45-2.5-7.5-1.1-9.65 1-1.53 2.56-2.43 4.04-2.43 1.5 0 2.45.82 3.7.82 1.2 0 1.94-.82 3.68-.82 1.32 0 2.72.72 3.7 1.96-3.25 1.78-2.72 6.42.45 7.58Z"/></svg>'
    }; %>
    <% const platformIconHtml = (platform, label) => {
        const src = platformLogos[platform] || '';
        if (src) return '<img class="platform-logo-img" src="' + escapeAttr(src) + '" alt="' + escapeAttr(label || platform) + '">';
        return '<span class="platform-mark platform-mark-' + escapeAttr(platform) + '" aria-hidden="true">' + (platformFallbackSvgs[platform] || '') + '</span>';
    }; %>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="brand-bar">
                <a class="brand" href="/app" aria-label="Open Edutrack">
                    <img src="/uploads/logos/system-logo.png" alt="Edutrack Logo">
                    <span>
                        <strong>Edutrack</strong>
                        <span>Schools Division of Sipalay City</span>
                    </span>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-grid">
                <div class="phone-shell" aria-label="Edutrack mobile dashboard preview">
                    <div class="phone-screen">
                        <div class="phone-header">
                            <div class="phone-brand">
                                <img src="/uploads/logos/system-logo.png" alt="">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="phone-title">Edutrack</div>
                                    <div class="phone-subtitle">Schools Division of Sipalay City</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="phone-chip-row">
                                <span class="phone-chip"><i class="live-dot"></i>LIVE</span>
                                <span class="phone-chip">Fri, May 29</span>
                                <span class="phone-chip"><%= safeStats.today || '' %></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="phone-body">
                            <div class="greeting-card">
                                <small>Good morning</small>
                                <strong>Juan Dela Cruz</strong>
                                <small>Friday, May 29, 2026</small>
                                <div class="stat-row">
                                    <div class="compact-stat"><i class="compact-icon present"></i><b><%= totalStudents %></b><span>Students</span></div>
                                    <div class="compact-stat"><i class="compact-icon present"></i><b><%= presentToday %></b><span>Present</span></div>
                                    <div class="compact-stat"><i class="compact-icon absent"></i><b><%= safeStats.absentToday || 0 %></b><span>Absent</span></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="analytics-card">
                                <div class="ring" style="--rate:<%= attendanceRate %>%"><span><%= attendanceRate %>%</span></div>
                                <div class="analytics-copy">
                                    <strong>Today Analytics</strong>
                                    <span><%= presentToday %> of <%= totalStudents %> students present</span>
                                    <div class="rate-line">
                                        <span>Live rate</span>
                                        <span><%= attendanceRate %>%</span>
                                        <div class="rate-track" style="--rate:<%= attendanceRate %>%"><i></i></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <span style="margin-top:10px;color:#7a8b84;"><%= safeStats.absentToday || 0 %> student absent</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="weekly-card">
                                <div class="weekly-title">
                                    Weekly Absence Analytics
                                    <small>Absent students per day (Mon-Fri)</small>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bars">
                                    <span class="day">Mon<i>1</i></span>
                                    <span class="day">Tue<i>2</i></span>
                                    <span class="day">Wed<i>1</i></span>
                                    <span class="day">Thu<i>3</i></span>
                                    <span class="day">Fri<i>1</i></span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="phone-nav">
                            <span><b class="home"></b>Home</span>
                            <span><b class="attendance"></b>Attendance</span>
                            <span><b class="schools"></b>Schools</span>
                            <span><b class="report"></b>Report</span>
                            <span><b class="alerts"></b>Alerts</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="hero-copy">
                    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span>Live Edutrack Platform</div>
                    <h1>Access Attendance Monitoring Anytime, Anywhere</h1>
                    <p class="lead">
                        <span>Stay connected with real-time attendance records, student monitoring, absence alerts, reports, school information, and adviser communication tools through the Edutrack platform.</span>
                        <span>Access the same synchronized data across the web platform, Android devices, and IOS devices through a secure cloud-based system.</span>
                    </p>
                    <div class="download-row">
                        <a class="store-button <%= apkAvailable ? '' : 'disabled' %>" href="/download/mobile-app" download>
                            <%- platformIconHtml('android', 'Android logo') %>
                            Download Android App
                        </a>
                        <a class="store-button ios-coming" href="/download/ios-app" download title="Download the Edutrack IOS app package when available.">
                            <%- platformIconHtml('ios', 'iOS logo') %>
                            Download IOS App
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="status">
                        <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
                            <%= error %>
                        <% } else if (apkAvailable) { %>
                            Android and IOS applications are available for secure and real-time attendance monitoring.
                        <% } else { %>
                            Android app package is being prepared for secure and real-time attendance monitoring.
                        <% } %>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <main id="apps" class="content">
        <section class="desktop-showcase" aria-label="Edutrack desktop dashboard preview">
            <div class="desktop-copy">
                <span class="desktop-kicker">Desktop Dashboard</span>
                <h3>Open the Edutrack dashboard on Mac and Windows.</h3>
                <p>The desktop launcher shows the same Edutrack dashboard used by the web system, including live attendance totals, absence alerts, monthly analytics, school rankings, and user access controls.</p>
                <div class="desktop-actions">
                    <a class="desktop-download" href="/download/windows-app" download><%- platformIconHtml('windows', 'Windows logo') %> Download Windows App</a>
                    <a class="desktop-download secondary" href="/download/mac-app" download><%- platformIconHtml('mac', 'Mac logo') %> Download Mac App</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="macbook" aria-label="MacBook preview of the Edutrack dashboard">
                <div class="mac-lid">
                    <span class="mac-camera"></span>
                    <div class="mac-screen">
                        <div class="sds-ui">
                            <aside class="sds-sidebar">
                                <div class="sds-side-brand">
                                    <img src="/uploads/logos/system-logo.png" alt="">
                                    <div>
                                        <strong>Edutrack</strong>
                                        <span>Schools Division of Sipalay City</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="sds-menu-label">Overview</div>
                                <div class="sds-nav-item active">Dashboard</div>
                                <div class="sds-menu-label">Attendance</div>
                                <div class="sds-nav-item">Attendance</div>
                                <div class="sds-nav-item">Reports</div>
                                <div class="sds-menu-label">Communication</div>
                                <div class="sds-nav-item">Notifications</div>
                                <div class="sds-side-user">
                                    <span class="sds-skeleton dark" style="width:72px;height:7px;"></span>
